message: "If you use Med-AGCNet in your research, please cite this software."
title: "Med-AGCNet: Adaptive Global Context Network for Medical Image Classification"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-10

authors:
  - family-names: "Mahmoudian"
    given-names: "Amir Mohammad"

repository-code: "https://github.com/mahmmooudian/Med-AGCNet"
url: "https://github.com/mahmmooudian/Med-AGCNet"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - medical image classification
  - deep learning
  - convolutional neural networks
  - global context
  - attention mechanisms
  - medical imaging
  - Grad-CAM
  - PyTorch
  - Med-AGCNet

abstract: >
  Med-AGCNet is a PyTorch-based deep learning architecture for medical image
  classification that combines local convolutional feature extraction,
  large receptive-field modeling, global context attention, and adaptive
  feature fusion. The implementation provides a reproducible research
  pipeline including training, evaluation, baseline comparisons, ablation
  studies, threshold optimization, and Grad-CAM-based explainability.
